# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Use this section to onboard people and teams to HMCTS Platform services.

Manage access through Microsoft Entra ID groups wherever possible. Access changes should be self-service and managed in code; only the first person in a team may need Platform Operations help.

- [Person](person/index.html): add a new starter to existing access groups and tools.
- [Team](team/index.html): set up team-owned access, repositories and shared tooling.
